config RDMA_THUNDERBOLT_FRAME_RXE
	tristate "rxe-derived RDMA engine over the thunderbolt_frame service"
	depends on INFINIBAND
	select CRC32
	help
	  Soft RDMA provider forked from the rdma_rxe driver with its
	  UDP/IP network transport replaced by the thunderbolt_frame
	  lossless frame service on Thunderbolt/USB4 XDomain DMA rings.
	  The uverbs ABI and driver id are unchanged, so the rdma-core
	  usb4-rdma-provider remains the userspace provider. See
	  drivers/thunderbolt_frame/docs/frame-rxe-wire-spec.md.
